# Topic permissions for pcwake.
#
# The point of this file: a compromised agent should be able to talk about
# itself and nothing more. It cannot send commands, and it cannot read or
# forge another machine's status.

# The hub drives everything: it reads status, info and acks from every host,
# and it is the only client allowed to publish commands.
user hub
topic read pcwake/+/status
topic read pcwake/+/info
topic read pcwake/+/ack
topic write pcwake/+/cmd

# Each agent owns exactly one host's topics. Duplicate this block per PC,
# with one mosquitto_passwd user per agent, and replace "desk" with that
# host's name.
user agent
topic write pcwake/desk/status
topic write pcwake/desk/info
topic write pcwake/desk/ack
topic read pcwake/desk/cmd
